::  modules/comlink/glow/fold-comlink-turn.glow -- 112B replay guard
/!  16384
|%
++  fold-comlink-turn
  |=  [pkt-bytes=@ud prev-seq=@ud incoming-seq=@ud]     ::  112B or 1200B wire
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  updated high-water
  ~|  'comlink-oversize-packet'                         ::  wire MTU ceiling
  ?>  (lte pkt-bytes 1200)                              ::  <= 1200B UDP cap
  ~|  'comlink-replayed-turn-refused'                   ::  strictly newer seq
  ?>  (gte incoming-seq +(prev-seq))                    ::  monotonic sequence
  incoming-seq
--
